    "File ▸ Print (⌘P) prints the open view: forms one record per page (Print All Records for every record), lists with the header on every page. Export View as PDF saves the same pages." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "gl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ficheiro ▸ Imprimir (⌘P) imprime a vista aberta: os formularios, un rexistro por páxina (Imprimir todos os rexistros para todos), e as listas coa cabeceira en cada páxina. Exportar vista como PDF garda as mesmas páxinas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "gl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buscar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find (⇧⌘F) blanks the form so you can type what to look for in any fields — e.g. a town in one field and > 1990 in a year field — then press Find. Use = for exact, ≠ for “not”, < > ≤ ≥ for ranges; = alone finds empty fields. Clear with the × on the chip." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "gl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buscar (⇧⌘F) deixa o formulario en branco para que escribas o que buscas en calquera campo — p. ex. unha vila nun campo e > 1990 nun campo de ano — e despois preme Buscar. Usa = para exacto, ≠ para “non”, < > ≤ ≥ para intervalos; = só atopa campos baleiros. Quita o filtro co × da etiqueta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find (top right) ignores accents, commas and word order: “Smith, John” also finds “John Smith”." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "gl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buscar (arriba á dereita) ignora acentos, comas e a orde das palabras: “Pérez, Ana” tamén atopa “Ana Pérez”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find (top right) narrows the records to those containing your words — accents, commas and word order don’t matter." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "gl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buscar (arriba á dereita) reduce os rexistros aos que conteñen as túas palabras — os acentos, as comas e a orde non importan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find by form" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "gl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buscar co formulario"
