    "if … then … else … chooses. Text: text() length() upper() lower() trim() left(t, n) right(t, n) mid(t, start, n). Numbers: number() round(x, decimals) abs() int() min(a, b) max(a, b)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "gl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "if … then … else … escolle. Texto: text() length() upper() lower() trim() left(t, n) right(t, n) mid(t, inicio, n). Números: number() round(x, decimais) abs() int() min(a, b) max(a, b)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Helix, import this file into the same view: columns follow the view’s tab order. If text contains returns, keep “Vertical tab” (or pick the ASCII 30 record delimiter and set the same in the view’s import settings)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
